# The artifacts in this directory are exact wire payloads, not source files.
#
# Any end-of-line normalisation changes the bytes: these are copies verified by
# git hash-object against the canonical set in the Percy repository, and a
# checkout on a host with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise get a CRLF
# rendering of them rather than the committed bytes.
#
# README.md is deliberately not listed; it is an ordinary source file.
*.json -text
